    "detailed_description": "Defend a race of spacefaring dogs by smashing invading aliens into space via a super powered mecha-ball in this physics roguelite.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your mecha-ball with different abilities such as a bazooka, powerful thrusters, recall beacon, and more. Tailor your strategy to your personal play style and make the best of the upgrade options provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe aliens have evolved different ways to wage their unending war with the dogs. Some soar into the air, some are shielded, while others bombard from afar.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new upgrades, explore each level, and smash those aliens into outer space in this fast paced roguelite.",
